    "updated_at": "2017-03-08T08:24:31Z",
    "body": "High-level question: are we any closer to figuring out what incumbent means, if anything, in non-Gecko implementations? Last time we discussed this nobody really knew and they might not even have such a concept, so I'm wondering if we're just keeping Gecko technical debt alive because we don't really know what else to do?",
