    "updated_at": "2017-03-08T16:41:13Z",
    "body": "> There are certainly no constructors on the web platform that inspect the incumbent\r\n\r\nApart from https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/comms.html#dom-broadcastchannel but I guess that can never be a subclass of HTMLElement?  Or can it, if people mess with the proto chains?\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
